只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Open-source LLM knowledge platform: turn raw documents into a queryable RAG, an autonomous reasoning agent, and a self-maintaining Wiki.","id":"gh:1024118326","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"WeKnora","slug":"Tencent/WeKnora","topics":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","dsh-plugin","embeddings","evaluation","generative-ai","golang","knowledge-base","llm","multi-tenant","ollama","openai","question-answering","rag","reranking","semantic-search","vector-search","wiki"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Open-source LLM knowledge platform: turn raw documents into a queryable RAG, an autonomous reasoning"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" agent, and a self-maintaining Wiki."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · 日本語 · 한국어"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Overview ·\nQuick Start ·\nWhat's New ·\nFeatures ·\nClients ·\nDocs ·\nDevelopment"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"WeKnora is an open-source, LLM-powered knowledge framework for enterprise document understanding, se"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"mantic retrieval and reasoning. It brings a team's documents together so they can be searched, reaso"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ned over and kept up to date."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de0e490a-e738-405e-bb3a-64b63edd7278"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"v0.9.0 · 2:45 · 1080p60 · English narration and subtitles"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Use RAG to look things up, the agent for multi-step tasks, and the wiki to organize knowledge. All t"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"hree work on the same knowledge bases."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**The agent's toolbox.** Skills installed from ClawHub / SkillHub / Git / ZIP run in session-persist"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ent Docker / E2B / Cube sandboxes, with an interactive terminal and graphical desktop beside the cha"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"t. Through the BrowserSkill extension the agent operates the user's own Chrome or Edge, and external"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" MCP services (OAuth included) can be connected and enabled tool by tool."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Beyond the three modes:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Memory and curation**: cross-session long-term memory keeps the profile, preferences and facts a"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" user has confirmed. Folder uploads keep their directory tree, and retrieval chunks can be edited, d"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"iffed and rolled back.\n- **Data sources and formats**: auto-sync from Feishu wiki / Feishu Drive / C"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"onfluence / GitLab / Tencent IMA / Notion / Yuque / DingTalk Docs / Seafile / RSS, with more on the "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"way. 10+ document formats including PDF, Word, images, Excel and XMind; Office files are parsed in-p"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"rocess by anydoc.\n- **Channels and integrations**: Q&A; in WeCom, Feishu, Slack, Telegram and other "},{"id":"p11s7","text":"IM apps; an embed widget for external websites; a built-in MCP Server for Cursor, Claude and other A"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"I tools; scoped API keys with a principal model for programmatic access.\n- **Models**: 29 built-in v"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"endors with a generated model catalog, including OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen (Alibaba Cloud), Zhipu, Huny"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"uan, Gemini, MiniMax, NVIDIA, LiteLLM and Ollama.\n- **Permissions and operations**: multi-workspace "},{"id":"p11s11","text":"RBAC (four roles, per-resource ownership, per-workspace audit log), several storage instances per wo"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"rkspace, a runtime task-queue dashboard with worker-pool governance, and Langfuse tracing for agent "},{"id":"p11s13","text":"steps, token usage and pipelines.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"ONLINE"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"WeChat Dialog Open Platform"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Manage knowledge bases online and connect Q&A; to Official Accounts, Mini Programs and other WeChat "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"wledge bases online and connect Q&A; to Official Accounts, Mini Programs and other WeChat scenarios."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open the platform →"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"CLOUD"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Tencent Cloud Lighthouse"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Deploy WeKnora from an application template and run it on your own cloud server."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Deploy on Tencent Cloud →"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"SELF-HOSTED"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Your own environment"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Deploy with Docker or Kubernetes and configure models, storage and networking yourself."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Run with Docker Compose ↓"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Run with Docker Compose"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Requires Docker, Docker Compose and Git."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Then open **http://localhost** and follow the onboarding guide. A walkthrough with sample data is in"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"://localhost** and follow the onboarding guide. A walkthrough with sample data is in the Quickstart."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> [!TIP]\n> To use a local Ollama model, run `ollama serve > /dev/null 2>&1 &` first. For the Ollama "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"embedding model name, `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`, and RAM notes, see Configuration."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Service | URL |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Web UI | `http://localhost` |\n| Backend API | `http://localhost:8080` |\n| Langfuse Tracing | `http"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"://localhost:3000` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Optional services"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Add `--profile` flags to enable additional components; multiple profiles can be combined."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Profile | Adds |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| _(default)_ | Core services |\n| `full` | All features |\n| `neo4j` | Knowledge Graph (Neo4j) |\n| `m"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"inio` | Object Storage (MinIO) |\n| `langfuse` | Tracing (Langfuse) |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### Upgrading"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"If you already have WeKnora running and downloaded a newer release:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> `docker compose up -d` alone reuses locally cached images and may leave the UI version o"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ut of sync with the release you downloaded. Read the upgrade notes before upgrading. Deployments old"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"er than v0.8.2 should also read the v0.8.2 notes."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Other ways to deploy"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Option | When to use it |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| **Docker Compose** | The standard deployment above: all features, multiple services |\n| **Kubernet"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"es (Helm)** | Production clusters; the chart is in `helm/` |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## What's New"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"A modular pipeline from document parsing, vectorization and retrieval to LLM inference, in which eve"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"ry component can be replaced or extended. It runs locally or on a private cloud, and the Web UI need"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"s no setup to get started. More: Architecture overview · RAG pipeline · Extension points."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| Area | Highlights |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| Q&A; and agent | Quick Q&A; answers from knowledge bases with citations; smart reasoning runs a Re"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"Act agent over knowledge bases, web search, MCP tools, skills and the local browser. Steer, fork or "},{"id":"p49s3","text":"rewind a running conversation, and keep long-term memory across sessions |\n| Wiki | Agent-generated,"},{"id":"p49s4","text":" interlinked wiki pages with a knowledge graph; in-browser editing, revision diff and rollback |\n| S"},{"id":"p49s5","text":"kills and sandbox | Skill catalog installed from ClawHub / SkillHub / Git / ZIP; session-persistent "},{"id":"p49s6","text":"Docker / E2B / Cube sandboxes with network policy; terminal and graphical desktop beside the chat |\n"},{"id":"p49s7","text":"| Knowledge bases | FAQ, document and wiki bases; folder tree; chunk editing with revisions; per-upl"},{"id":"p49s8","text":"oad parsing, chunking and multimodal settings; auto-tagging |\n| Retrieval | Keyword + vector hybrid "},{"id":"p49s9","text":"search, rerank, parent-child chunking and GraphRAG (Neo4j); end-to-end evaluation with recall and BL"},{"id":"p49s10","text":"EU / ROUGE |\n| Access and security | Workspace RBAC with four roles and an audit log; scoped API key"},{"id":"p49s11","text":"s; OIDC; AES-256-GCM credential encryption; SSRF-safe outbound requests with a whitelist-only mode |"},{"id":"p49s12","text":"\n| Operations | Langfuse tracing for agent steps, tokens and pipelines; document parsing timeline; t"},{"id":"p49s13","text":"ask-queue dashboard with worker pools; automatic migrations on upgrade |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
